#
msgid ""
msgstr "Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"

msgid "Add Rule"
msgstr "Gehitu araua"

msgid ""
"Add rules to define which profile and entity the user will receive based on "
"their email domain (Optional)."
msgstr ""
"Gehitu arauak erabiltzaileak zein profil eta entitate jasoko dituen posta "
"elektronikoaren domeinuaren arabera definitzeko (Aukerakoa)."

msgid "Automatically create users on first login"
msgstr "Sortu erabiltzaileak automatikoki lehenengo saio-hasieran"

msgid "Configuration updated."
msgstr "Konfigurazioa eguneratu da."

msgid "Default Rule (Fallback)"
msgstr "Arau Lehenetsia (Fallback)"

msgid "Default entity (ELSE)"
msgstr "Entitate lehenetsia (BESTELA)"

msgid "Default profile (ELSE)"
msgstr "Profil lehenetsia (BESTELA)"

msgid "Domain (after @)"
msgstr "Domeinua (@ ondoren)"

msgid "Entity"
msgstr "Entitatea"

msgid "Failed to create the user in GLPI."
msgstr "Ezin izan da erabiltzailea GLPIn sortu."

msgid "Google SSO"
msgstr "Google SSO"

msgid "Google SSO — Configuration"
msgstr "Google SSO — Konfigurazioa"

msgid "Google authentication failed: %s"
msgstr "Google autentifikazioak huts egin du: %s"

msgid "Google login cancelled: %s"
msgstr "Google saio-hasiera bertan behera utzi da: %s"

msgid "Google response without authorization code."
msgstr "Google-ren erantzuna baimen-koderik gabe."

msgid ""
"If the user email does not match any of the rules above, this profile and "
"entity will be used. Mandatory if automatic creation is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Erabiltzailearen helbide elektronikoa aurreko arauekin bat ez badator, "
"profil eta entitate hau erabiliko dira. Derrigorrezkoa sorrera automatikoa "
"gaituta badago."

msgid "Invalid OAuth2 state. Try again from the login page."
msgstr "OAuth2 egoera baliogabea. Saiatu berriro saio-hasiera orritik."

msgid "Leave blank to keep current secret (stored encrypted)."
msgstr "Utzi hutsik uneko sekretua mantentzeko (enkriptatuta gordeta)."

msgid "No GLPI user corresponds to this Google account."
msgstr "Ez dago GLPI erabiltzailerik Google kontu honi dagokiona."

msgid "Only accounts from the %s domain are accepted."
msgstr "%s domeinuko kontuak soilik onartzen dira."

msgid "Profile"
msgstr "Profila"

msgid "Profile and Entity Rules by Domain"
msgstr "Profil eta Entitate Arauak Domeinuaren arabera"

msgid "Register this Redirect URI in Google Cloud Console:"
msgstr "Erregistratu birbideratze-URI hau Google Cloud Console-n:"

msgid "Restrict to domain (optional)"
msgstr "Mugatu domeinura (aukerakoa)"

msgid "Save"
msgstr "Gorde"

msgid "Select..."
msgstr "Hautatu..."

msgid "Session not initialized: user has no enabled profile."
msgstr "Saioa ez da hasi: erabiltzaileak ez du gaitutako profilik."

msgid "Sign in with Google"
msgstr "Hasi saioa Google-rekin"

msgid "The Google account does not have a verified email."
msgstr "Google kontuak ez du egiaztatutako posta elektronikorik."

msgid "This user is deactivated in GLPI."
msgstr "Erabiltzaile hau GLPIn desgaituta dago."

msgid "or"
msgstr "edo"

msgid ""
"Leave the option <strong>\"Remove domain of logins in form "
"login@domain\"</strong> as <strong>No</strong>. If enabled, users with the "
"same prefix in different providers (e.g., admin@gmail.com and "
"admin@institution.edu.br) will suffer account overlap."
msgstr ""
"Utzi <strong>\"Kendu saio-hasieraren domeinua login@domain "
"formularioan\"</strong> aukera <strong>Ez</strong> gisa. Gaituta badago, "
"hornitzaile ezberdinetan aurrizki bera duten erabiltzaileek (adibidez, "
"admin@gmail.com eta admin@institution.edu.br) kontua gainjartzea jasango "
"dute."

msgid ""
"Check the <strong>Activate \"Sign in with Google\" button</strong> option "
"below and click <strong>Save</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Egiaztatu beheko <strong>Aktibatu \"Hasi saioa Google-rekin\" "
"botoia</strong> aukera eta sakatu <strong>Gorde</strong>."

msgid ""
"Change the <strong>Automatically add users from an external authentication "
"source</strong> field to <strong>Yes</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Aldatu <strong>Gehitu erabiltzaileak automatikoki kanpoko autentifikazio-"
"iturburu batetik</strong> eremua <strong>Bai</strong>."

msgid "Step 1: Google Cloud Preparation"
msgstr "1. urratsa: Google Cloud prestatzea"

msgid "Critical Warning:"
msgstr "Abisu kritikoa:"

msgid "How to enable Google SSO integration?"
msgstr "Nola gaitu Google SSO integrazioa?"

msgid ""
"Google will generate a <strong>Client ID</strong> and a <strong>Client "
"Secret</strong>. Fill in the fields in this form with those keys."
msgstr ""
"Google-k <strong>Bezero IDa</strong> eta <strong>Bezeroaren "
"sekretua</strong> sortuko ditu. Bete formulario honetako eremuak gako "
"horiekin."

msgid ""
"Access the <a href=\"https://console.cloud.google.com/\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Google Cloud Console</a> and create a new "
"<strong>Project</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Sartu <a href=\"https://console.cloud.google.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Google"
" Cloud Console</a> eta sortu <strong>Proiektu</strong> berri bat."

msgid "Redirect URI:"
msgstr "Birbideratzeko URIa:"

msgid "Activate \"Sign in with Google\" button"
msgstr "Aktibatu \"Hasi saioa Google-rekin\" botoia"

msgid ""
"Then go to <strong>Credentials &gt; Create Credentials &gt; OAuth client "
"ID</strong>, choosing the <strong>Web application</strong> type."
msgstr ""
"Ondoren, joan <strong>Kredentzialak &gt; Sortu kredentzialak &gt; OAuth "
"bezero ID</strong>, <strong>Web aplikazioa</strong> mota aukeratuz."

msgid "Step 2: GLPI Authentication Preparation"
msgstr "2. urratsa: GLPI autentifikazioa prestatzea"

msgid ""
"Go to <strong>APIs &amp; Services &gt; OAuth consent screen</strong> and "
"configure your app (add the scopes <code>email</code>, <code>profile</code>,"
" and <code>openid</code>)."
msgstr ""
"Joan <strong>APIak &amp; Zerbitzuak &gt; OAuth baimenaren pantaila</strong> "
"eta konfiguratu aplikazioa (gehitu esparruak <code>posta "
"elektronikoa</code>, <code>profila</code> eta <code>openid</code>)."

msgid "In GLPI, go to <strong>Setup &gt; Authentication &gt; Setup</strong>."
msgstr ""
"GLPIn, joan <strong>Konfigurazioa &gt; Autentifikazioa &gt; "
"Konfigurazioa</strong>."

msgid ""
"Under <strong>Authorized redirect URIs</strong>, copy and paste exactly the "
"return URL below:"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Baimendutako birbideratze URIak</strong> atalean, kopiatu eta "
"itsatsi zehatz-mehatz itzultzeko URLa behean:"

msgid ""
"Subdomains are also accepted. E.g.: \"company.com\" will allow "
"user@company.com and user@sub.company.com."
msgstr ""
"Azpidomeinuak ere onartzen dira. Adib.: \"company.com\"-ek user@company.com "
"eta user@sub.company.com baimenduko ditu."

msgid ""
"To test the account creation rules and discover which Profile/Entity will be"
" assigned to an email,"
msgstr ""
"Kontua sortzeko arauak probatzeko eta mezu elektroniko bati zein "
"profil/entitate esleituko zaion jakiteko,"

msgid ""
"The plugin calls <code>Session::init()</code>. The GLPI core loads the "
"user\\'s profiles and starts the session. The user is redirected to the "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Pluginak <code>Session::init()</code> deitzen du. GLPI nukleoak "
"erabiltzailearen profilak kargatzen ditu eta saioa hasten du. Erabiltzailea "
"panelera birbideratzen da."

msgid "Error Creating Account"
msgstr "Errore bat gertatu da kontua sortzean"

msgid "No Profile Configured"
msgstr "Ez dago profilik konfiguratuta"

msgid "Database Search"
msgstr "Datu-baseen bilaketa"

msgid "Do you wish to proceed and create your account now?"
msgstr "Aurrera egin eta zure kontua sortu nahi duzu orain?"

msgid "click here"
msgstr "egin klik hemen"

msgid "Auto Creation Disabled"
msgstr "Sorkuntza automatikoa desgaituta dago"

msgid "Rules Simulator"
msgstr "Arauen simulagailua"

msgid ""
"The system would log into the existing account <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d)."
" No new account would be created."
msgstr ""
"Sistemak lehendik dagoen kontuan <strong>%s</strong> sartuko luke (ID: %d). "
"Ez da kontu berririk sortuko."

msgid "▶️ Simulate Login"
msgstr "▶️ Simulatu saioa"

msgid ""
"Extracted domain: <strong>@%s</strong>. Applied rule: <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Erauzitako domeinua: <strong>@%s</strong>. Aplikatu den araua: "
"<strong>%s</strong>"

msgid "Configuration Read"
msgstr "Konfigurazioa Irakurri"

msgid "User \"%s\" already exists. Login would be performed successfully."
msgstr "\"%s\" erabiltzailea jada existitzen da. Saioa ongi egingo litzateke."

msgid ""
"The email domain \"<strong>%s</strong>\" is not allowed. The plugin "
"restricts access to the domain \"<strong>%s</strong>\" or its subdomains."
msgstr ""
"\"<strong>%s</strong>\" posta elektronikoko domeinua ez da onartzen. "
"Pluginak \"<strong>%s</strong>\" domeinurako edo bere azpidomeinuetarako "
"sarbidea mugatzen du."

msgid ""
"The plugin calls <code>User::add()</code> to create the user "
"\"<strong>%s</strong>\"."
msgstr ""
"Pluginak <code>User::add()</code> deitzen du \"<strong>%s</strong>\" "
"erabiltzailea sortzeko."

msgid "using the primary email:"
msgstr "posta elektroniko nagusia erabiliz:"

msgid "User::add() called"
msgstr "Erabiltzailea::add() deitua"

msgid "Profile Determined by Plugin"
msgstr "Pluginak zehazten duen profila"

msgid ""
"Profile: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d) | Entity: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d)"
msgstr ""
"Profila: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d) | Entitatea: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: "
"%d)"

msgid ""
"The email domain \"<strong>%s</strong>\" is allowed by the restriction rule."
msgstr ""
"\"<strong>%s</strong>\" posta elektronikoko domeinua murrizketa-arauak "
"onartzen du."

msgid "Core Default Profile Assigned"
msgstr "Core lehenetsitako profila esleitu da"

msgid "Verified email present: <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr "Egiaztatutako helbide elektronikoa: <strong>%s</strong>"

msgid "The user \"%s\" DOES NOT exist and auto-creation is disabled."
msgstr ""
"\"%s\" erabiltzailea EZ DA existitzen eta sorkuntza automatikoa desgaituta "
"dago."

msgid "Profile Correction by Plugin"
msgstr "Profilaren zuzenketa Plugin bidez"

msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Bai"

msgid "To access the system via Google, a new account will be created for"
msgstr "Google bidez sistemara sartzeko, kontu berri bat sortuko da"

msgid "Rule Used"
msgstr "Erabilitako araua"

msgid "Plugin googlesso step"
msgstr "Plugin googlesso urratsa"

msgid "Simulator:"
msgstr "Simulagailua:"

msgid "Account Creation Required"
msgstr "Kontua sortu behar da"

msgid "Domain Rule for \"%s\""
msgstr "\"%s\" domeinu-araua"

msgid ""
"This simulator faithfully reproduces the entire execution chain — from the "
"plugin logic to the internal GLPI Core behavior. Enter an email and see "
"step-by-step what would happen in a real login."
msgstr ""
"Simulagailu honek exekuzio kate osoa erreproduzitzen du zintzotasunez, "
"pluginaren logikatik hasi eta barneko GLPI Core portaeraraino. Sartu mezu "
"elektroniko bat eta ikusi urratsez urrats zer gertatuko litzatekeen benetako"
" saioa hasteko."

msgid "Back to configuration"
msgstr "Itzuli konfiguraziora"

msgid "Account Creation Confirmation"
msgstr "Kontua sortzearen berrespena"

msgid "Domain Rules"
msgstr "Domeinu-arauak"

msgid "Account Creation Simulator"
msgstr "Kontuak sortzeko simulagailua"

msgid "No"
msgstr "Ez"

msgid "No user found with the email <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Ez da erabiltzailerik aurkitu <strong>%s</strong> helbide elektronikoarekin"

msgid "Login / Email"
msgstr "Saioa hasi / Posta elektronikoa"

msgid ""
"The \"Automatically create users\" configuration is "
"<strong>DISABLED</strong>. The login would be blocked."
msgstr ""
"\"Sortu erabiltzaileak automatikoki\" konfigurazioa "
"<strong>DESAKTIBATUTA</strong> dago. Saioa blokeatu egingo litzateke."

msgid "(none)"
msgstr "(bat ere ez)"

msgid "Login blocked: Only accounts from the %s domain are accepted."
msgstr "Saioa blokeatuta: %s domeinuko kontuak bakarrik onartzen dira."

msgid "The user \"%s\" would be created successfully."
msgstr "\"%s\" erabiltzailea behar bezala sortuko da."

msgid ""
"The plugin removes the incorrect profiles assigned by GLPI and explicitly "
"links the profile <strong>%s</strong> and entity <strong>%s</strong> using "
"the <code>Profile_User</code> class."
msgstr ""
"Pluginak GLPIk esleitutako profil okerrak kentzen ditu eta "
"<strong>%s</strong> profila eta <strong>%s</strong> entitatea espresuki "
"lotzen ditu <code>Profile_User</code> klasea erabiliz."

msgid "Email Validation"
msgstr "Posta elektronikoaren baliozkotzea"

msgid "User found by email: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d)"
msgstr ""
"Posta elektronikoz aurkitutako erabiltzailea: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d)"

msgid "Domain Restriction Check"
msgstr "Domeinu-murrizketa egiaztatzea"

msgid "None"
msgstr "Bat ere ez"

msgid "Session::init() — Login Performed"
msgstr "Session::init() — Saioa hasi da"

msgid "Execution Chain (Step-by-Step)"
msgstr "Exekuzio-katea (urratsez-urrats)"

msgid "Login to Existing Account"
msgstr "Hasi saioa Lehendik dagoen kontuan"

msgid "How it works:"
msgstr "Nola funtzionatzen du:"

msgid ""
"In GLPI 11, the core ignores the profile passed by external authentications "
"and automatically assigns the global default profile (usually Self-Service) "
"to the new user."
msgstr ""
"GLPI 11n, nukleoak kanpoko autentifikazioek emandako profila baztertzen du "
"eta automatikoki esleitzen dio profil global lehenetsia (normalean "
"autozerbitzua) erabiltzaile berriari."

msgid "Final Entity"
msgstr "Azken Entitatea"

msgid "Final Result"
msgstr "Azken Emaitza"

msgid "Back to Login"
msgstr "Itzuli Saioa hasteko"

msgid "Simulated Email:"
msgstr "Posta elektroniko simulatua:"

msgid ""
"Restrict domain: <strong>%s</strong> | Auto create users: "
"<strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Murriztu domeinua: <strong>%s</strong> | Sortu automatikoki erabiltzaileak: "
"<strong>%s</strong>"

msgid "Final Profile"
msgstr "Azken profila"

msgid ""
"The user \"%s\" would be created, but without ANY profile. Access to GLPI "
"would be denied. Please configure a valid profile in the Default Rule or "
"Domain Rules."
msgstr ""
"\"%s\" erabiltzailea sortuko litzateke, baina INOLAKO profilik gabe. "
"GLPIrako sarbidea ukatuko litzateke. Mesedez, konfiguratu baliozko profil "
"bat Arau lehenetsian edo Domeinu-arauetan."

msgid "GLPI Core step"
msgstr "GLPI Core urratsa"

msgid ""
"No valid profile (ID > 0) was found in the plugin rules. The user would be "
"created WITHOUT a profile."
msgstr ""
"Ez da baliozko profilik (ID > 0) aurkitu plugin-arauetan. Erabiltzailea "
"profilik GABE sortuko litzateke."
